              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "herrschen — \"to rule, to reign; to prevail\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Der König herrschte vierzig Jahre. The king ruled for forty years."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also of a mood or the weather: Es herrschte Ruhe — quiet prevailed."
            }
          ]
        },
